Example:
{
  "character_updates": {
    "Elara": {
      "description": "A skilled tracker haunted by past failures",
      "traits": ["brave", "haunted"],
      "status": "Active protagonist",
      "relationships": {"Marcus": {"type": "ALLIES_WITH", "description": "trusted ally"}, "The Queen": {"type": "CONFLICTS_WITH", "description": "sworn enemy"}}
    }
  }
}

Per-character entry requirements:
- "description" (string): One sentence summary
- "traits" (array): Single-word descriptors only
- "status" (string): Current state or role
- "relationships" (object): Maps character names to {"type": string, "description": string}
  - Both endpoints must be selected Character entries; do not use item, location or event predicates for characters.
  - "type": MUST be one of the canonical relationship types listed above
  - "description": <= 180 chars

Extraction rules:
- Use proper names as keys
- Resolve pronouns only to exact names explicitly present in this text
- Skip background mentions and crowds

